            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "കോടതി അവന് ജാമ്യം നൽകി. kōṭati avanŭ jāmyaṁ nalki. The court granted him bail."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Bail is granted: ജാമ്യം (jāmyaṁ) നൽകുക. Out on bail is ജാമ്യത്തിൽ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of ജാമ്യം (jāmyaṁ) is not settled. It means a guarantee given to a court, so that the accused may go home until the trial."
            }
          ]
        },
