              "text": "ഞാൻ നിരപരാധിയാണ് എന്ന് അവൻ പറഞ്ഞു. ñān niraparādhiyāṇŭ ennŭ avan paṟaññu. He said that he was innocent."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "നിർ-, without, + അപരാധം, an offence: one who did nothing wrong."
            }
